<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">FOCUS WITH XIAOPEI</view><view class="title">专注</view><view class="subtitle">专注不是孤军奋战，我陪你一起</view><view class="card hero"><view class="badge">{{running ? '正在专注' : '准备开始'}}</view><view class="hero-title">{{running ? '稳稳地做眼前这一件事。' : '今天，也积累一点点'}}</view><view class="hero-copy">{{suggestion}}</view><view class="sun"></view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">本次专注目标</view><input class="goal-input" value="{{goal}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：完成高等数学第三章"/><view class="muted">小陪后端当前支持开始、停止、继续、休息和状态查询。</view><button wx:if="{{!running}}" class="button" loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="start">和小陪一起开始</button><button wx:else class="button secondary" loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="stop">结束本次专注</button></view></view>
